-- NAMING --------------- errors/unbound_variable_2.march

March has no `return`: a function's value is its last expression. [unbound_variable]
Write the value on its own as the block's last line. To leave a function early, use `if ... do ... else ... end` or `match`.

4 |     return x + 1
        ^^^^^^


    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

4 -     return x + 1
4 +     x + 1



after fix: exit 0
